      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "as a JSON-RPC Node.js developer amongst the many other languages i code in i can see this bringing vrchat to the next level. this would allow the more advanced content creators to create much more rich content. it would allow them to save data externally which would give map makers the ability to create their own analytics along with the possibility of creating games within maps that persist across maps. a user could create a role playing game where levels and stats save and load across worlds. amongst a whole range of other things made possible from an update like this. please consider this functionality",
